flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare select 1 from accounts by account_number]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind account number]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{Any row returned?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Return true]
    F -- No --> H[Return false]
    C --> I[On SQL error print stack trace]
    I --> H
    G --> J[End]
    H --> J
